The  utility is a macro processor that can be used as a front end
to any language (e.g., C, ratfor, fortran, lex, and yacc).  If no
input files are given, reads from the standard  input,  otherwise
files  specified  on  the command line are processed in the given
order.  Input files can be regular files, files  in  the  include
paths,  or  a  single  dash  denoting standard input.  writes the
processed text to the standard  output,  unless  told  otherwise.
